      4 
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">اشرج</span></b> , (AZ, S, A, O, Msb,) inf. n. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">إِشْرَاجٌ</span>;
(K;) and ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">شرّج</span></b> , (AZ, O,) inf. n. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">تَشْرِيجٌ</span>; (K;)
and ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">شَرَجَ</span></b> , (AZ, O,) inf. n. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">شَرْجٌ</span>; (K;) <i>He
